		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Elixir U</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — An elixir that grants an extra Action.</em></p><p><strong>Free Action.</strong> Gain +1 max Actions for 1 turn.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Lasts 1 + STR turns; you are Stunned for 1 round after the effect ends.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> +2 to Initiative rolls.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Grants +1 Action now.</em></p><p><em>[M] Repeat the +1 Action on each of the next STR turns, then Stunned for 1 round.</em></p>",
